                                                "sense_id": "a372f261-7131-3d60-99c1-481282f3cf8f",
                                                "text": "[…] when we got aſterne we grew becalm'd, land-lockt in a fort, and were ſported all the way […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c80a9155-34ac-4e9a-8d7c-d1cb2153f2fe",
                                                "sense_id": "a372f261-7131-3d60-99c1-481282f3cf8f",
                                                "text": "Although the breeze had now utterly failed, we had made a great deal of way during the night, and were now lying becalmed about half a mile to the southeast of the low eastern coast."
                                            }
